0.5 Vocabulary used in the code
"Quality" = one OLQ (codes EI RA OA PE SA CO SR IN SC SD IG LV DT CG ST). "Component" = one of academic | qualities | habits | participation | growth. "Combined figure" = the Learners Score. "Rule set" = one versioned set of every weight, threshold and mapping (RuleSet type). "Snapshot" = stored result for one student and one period; "live" changes on every save, "published" is frozen by approval. Avoid property names starting with total, overall, score, rank, grade, composite on existing objects: tests/support-and-care.test.ts deliberately fails on them.

